2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT ≤h4>Vejle, Hatting, Hatting, Hatting Sogn, Hatting Bye, 66, FT-1801, B8588≤/h4>trong>Status:&nbsp;≤/strong>≤/td>rensen M&oslash;ller&nbsp;&nbsp;≤/td>ren Thomasdatter&nbsp;&nbsp;≤/td>dersen&nbsp;&nbsp;≤/td>d>td>p;≤/td>
