2 FORM jpg
2 TITL Brallenborg Farm Tax Agreement_1798
2 NOTE Hansen, Herman arvefaester af Vamdrupgaard og ejer af "Brallenborg". 1798 opretter han tiendeforening med praesten Fr. Chr. Fries. Se denne.
3 CONT =
3 CONT Hansen, Herman copyholder of Vamdrupgaard and owner of Brallenborg. 1798 he concluded a 1/10-agreement with the vicard Fr(ederik) Chr(istian) Fries. See this person.
3 CONT
3 CONT (Tiende var a tax to the church, which was introduced 1100 under King Niels. The farmers should pay 1/10 of their crop, divided 1/3 to the church, 1/3 to the vicars (their wages was often low), and 1/3 to the bishops.
